      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "AssertExternallySynchronizedMutex move and move-assignment operators probably wrong",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "NOT SURE how this could have gone so long unnoticed, except that I wasn't useing move properly elswehere so it just may not have been triggered much.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Anyhow - I THINK I fixed what was being triggered in the AssertExternallySynchronizedMutex::operator= (MOVE)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "but not clear if I should move copy the shared part or not.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "And pretty sure the COPY assign logic should be the same as themove assign logic, but no error triggered there yet.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
      },
